    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "庞大的仪器瞬间吸引了卡特斯的目光。\n她感觉到天旋地转，仪器扭曲了光，也扭曲了她的意识。\n在卡特斯的眼中，它时而以肉眼无法捕捉的速度旋转，时而却又完全静止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，它、它好像还是在动，很慢......很慢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她不敢再直视那个似乎可以完全吞噬她意识的仪器，却也控制不住身体的倒下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那位冰冷的同行者接住了她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "思维。共振。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接受。它。放弃。抵抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聆听。自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_g2_rhodeslivingroom_bc"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡特斯瞬间听到了数种不同的音调......\n雷姆必拓语，乌萨斯语，维多利亚语，还有她从教士口中听闻过的高卢语。而更多的，是她从未听闻过的奇异音调。\n但她却诡异地理解了那个词语的含义——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（奇怪的音调）“死亡”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（奇怪的音调）♫"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我能听懂您的声音......为什么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "思维可以被锚定，言语可以被破译。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "语言是工具，是权利，也是重塑我们存在的元素之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安塞塔，是这一时间片中最为伟大的发明之一。我们抹除了语言的障碍，我们填补了文明的隔阂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个符号......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "思维的锚，解释所有已知语言的元文字，也是解析未知语言的工具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“死亡”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是如今你所思考最多的言语，希尔达。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“降生”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是你们的交流方式......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "声音的交流并不高效，但充满了趣味，反映我们的情绪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "许多人依旧固执地保留了这样的传统，加深互相的情感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我并不完全理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在您能告诉我，这里是什么地方吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一艘在坟墓中打捞死亡的航船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们在被光照亮的废墟中寻找解答终极问题的答案......在同样的毁灭降临于我们的身上之前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在“死亡”降临之前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你所造访的地方，它的主人称呼它为......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“罗德岛”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡特斯感到困惑。\n她不再为所处环境的奇异而困惑，她困惑的是......\n神明，为什么会死去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
